# App dates

Full write-up: **`docs/APP_DATES.md`**. Implementation: **`lib/app_date_field.dart`**.

When adding or changing any date UI:

1. Use **`AppDateField`** for editable dates (type + calendar).
2. Display month/day/year (`Nov 14, 2026`) via `formatAppDate` / `formatAppDateText`.
3. Parse with `parseAppDate`. Commit on **blur** and Enter (built into `AppDateField`).
4. Persist to PocketBase as ISO `yyyy-MM-dd` via `formatAppDateIso`.

Never show editable dates as `yyyy-MM-dd`. Never use pick-only (`readOnly` + calendar) for normal shop dates unless the user explicitly asks.
